From 9d2519805fd0b63c489d01668420e4c52d59c3fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 23:48:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/40] audit(proofs): strict axiom gate, pinned statements,
 counterexamples, glue lemmas
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- audit/proofs/gen_axioms.py + AllAxioms.lean: #print axioms for all 79 theorems
  extracted from Figram/*.lean (not from verify.sh's list of 14)
- audit/proofs/AxiomGate.lean: environment-based gate over every theorem/def in
  Figram.* modules (fails on sorryAx, native_decide axioms, custom axioms)
- audit/proofs/strict_gate.sh: proposal replacing verify.sh 'Теоремы без sorry'
  (adds leanchecker kernel replay and pinned statements)
- audit/proofs/Statements.lean (+Negative): exact statements of README/AUDIT theorems
- audit/proofs/Counterexamples.lean (+Negative): what breaks without wf / DocWF,
  named timer: events bypass tokens in Core, text round trip failures
- audit/proofs/FigramAudit/Glue.lean (lean_lib FigramAudit, not a default target):
  check=[] -> compile.wf, Engine.load soundness, decEvent/timer token lemma,
  end-to-end engine step = Chart.step, start/restart SnapOK, decSnapshot soundness
- audit/proofs/TextRoundTrip.lean: regression test for annotation numbers (fails on baseline)

(cherry picked from commit e0091ba60c5629a9bbe847c9de9b14facdad2a8b)

